                'en' => 'The BEA-TT opened its investigation on 13 October 2011 and made two recommendations: the first, to Réseau ferré de France, the Ille-et-Vilaine département, the commune and the prefecture, to complete quickly the safety measures for the crossing announced in November 2011; the second, to the directorate general for infrastructure, transport and the sea, to evaluate the policy for improving crossings classed as of concern.',
